    "faq": {
      "type": "lw-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long before I notice a difference?",
            "answer": "<p>Most customers notice reduced bloating and smoother digestion within the first 1 to 2 weeks. Energy and clarity typically improve around weeks 3 to 6. For deeper liver support, 3 to 6 months of consistent use delivers the best results.†</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why should I choose the 2 or 3 bottle bundle?",
            "answer": "<p>Liver support is a process, not an event. The first 1 to 2 months start the clear. Deep cellular support happens from months 2 to 6. Most customers who report the biggest changes committed to at least a few months — and bundles give you the best price per bottle.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What makes LiverWell different from other milk thistle supplements?",
            "answer": "<p>Our milk thistle is standardized to 80% silymarin, the clinical threshold. We use 6 active ingredients that work together to support your body.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will this work if I've tried other supplements before?",
            "answer": "<p>Most liver supplements only address one piece of the problem. They either try to clear toxins or support liver health, but not both. LiverWell's 6-ingredient formula was built to support the full cycle. That's why customers who gave up on other products often see results with LiverWell.†</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I take it?",
            "answer": "<p>Take 1 capsule daily with water, preferably with a meal. For best results, take it at the same time each day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I take it with other supplements or medications?",
            "answer": "<p>LiverWell works well alongside most everyday supplements. Milk thistle may interact with certain medications (such as blood thinners, some diabetes medications and immunosuppressants), so if you take prescription medication, are pregnant or nursing, please consult your doctor first. If you're allergic to plants in the daisy family (ragweed, marigolds), check with your doctor before use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if it doesn't work for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Every order is protected by our 90-day money-back guarantee. No questions, no hassle. If you don't feel the difference, we'll refund every cent.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
